\\|status:\"\u001b[28X\u001b[27;75H\u001b[1K\u001b[31m\u001b[1m\rstatus:\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[28;75H\u001b[1K\r  activeWorkloads:\u001b[29;75H\u001b[1K\r  - default/nginx-demo\u001b[30;75H\u001b[1K\u001b[36m\r--\u001b[39m\u001b[31;75H\u001b[1K\r    \u001b[31m\u001b[1mstatus:\u001b(B\u001b[m \"True\"\u001b[32;75H\u001b[1K\r    type: Ready\r\n  \u001b[31m\u001b[1mlocalhostProfile\u001b(B\u001b[m: operator/default/nginx-demo.json\u001b[23X\u001b[34;75H\u001b[1K\r  \u001b[31m\u001b[1mstatus:\u001b(B\u001b[m Installed\u001b[32m\u001b[1m\r\nvboxuser@landlock\u001b(B\u001b[m:\u001b[34m\u001b[1m~/landlock-genprof\u001b(B\u001b[m$ \u001b[37X\u001b[32m\u001b[1m\r\nvboxuser@landlock\u001b(B\u001b[m:\u001b[34m\u001b[1m~/landlock-genprof\u001b(B\u001b[m$ \u001b[37X\u001b[32m\u001b[1m\r\nvboxuser@landlock\u001b(B\u001b[m:\u001b[34m\u001b[1m~/landlock-genprof\u001b(B\u001b[m$ \u001b[37X\u001b[32m\u001b[1m\r\nvboxuser@landlock\u001b(B\u001b[m:\u001b[34m\u001b[1m~/landlock-genprof\u001b(B\u001b[m$ \u001b[37X\u001b[32m\u001b[1m\r\nvboxuser@landlock\u001b(B\u001b[m:\u001b[34m\u001b[1m~/landlock-genprof\u001b(B\u001b[m$ kubectl landlock-genprof trace --help\u001b[40;75H\u001b[1K\r \r\nStarts a training run on a target pod and generates least-privilege securit\u001b[42;75H\u001b[1K\ry profiles\u001b[43;75H\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h\r"]
[281.673095, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[1;75H\u001b[1K\u001b[H  landlock-genprof trace [flags]\u001b[2;75H\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\rFlags:\r\n      --binary string                       Path of the main binary observe\r\nd, e.g. /usr/sbin/nginx (required) — filters events to this process, see do\u001b[6;75H\u001b[1K\rcs/usage.md for why\r\n      --capabilities-out string[=\"-\"]       Output file for a capabilities \r\nadd/drop fragment (default <pod>-capabilities.yaml); not a standalone resou\u001b[9;75H\u001b[1K\rrce, see docs/usage.md\r\n  -c, --container string                    Target container (deduced if th\u001b[11;75H\u001b[1K\re pod has only one)\r\n  -d, --duration duration                   Training run duration (default \u001b[13;75H\u001b[1K\r1m0s)\r\n  -h, --help                                help for trace\u001b[17X\r\n      --history                             Accumulate this run into a Trai\r\nningHistory resource for cross-run confidence. Requires additional RBAC — s\u001b[17;75H\u001b[1K\ree docs/usage.md\r\n  -n, --namespace string                    Kubernetes namespace (default \"\u001b[19;75H\u001b[1K\rdefault\")\r\n      --network-out string[=\"-\"]            Output file for a generated Net\r\nworkPolicy (default <pod>-networkpolicy.yaml); skipped if no network activi\u001b[22;75H\u001b[1K\rty was observed\r\n  -o, --out string                          Output file for the generated L\r\nandlockProfile (default: <pod>-profile.yaml)\u001b[31X\r\n      --patched-manifest-out string[=\"-\"]   Output file for a ready-to-appl\r\ny manifest with securityContext merged in (default <identity>-patched.yaml)\r\n; requires deploy/rbac-patched-manifest.yaml, see docs/usage.md\u001b[12X\r\n  -p, --pod string                          Target pod name (required)\u001b[5X\r\n      --report-out string[=\"-\"]             Output file for a combined Mark\r\ndown review report (default <pod>-report.md); always written when passed, w\u001b[31;75H\u001b[1K\rorks standalone — see docs/usage.md\r\n      --restart                             Restart the pod right before tr\r\nacing, to catch startup-time activity. Disruptive — requires deploy/rbac-re\u001b[34;75H\u001b[1K\rstart.yaml, see docs/usage.md\r\n      --seccomp-out string[=\"-\"]            Output file for a generated sec\r\ncomp profile (default <pod>-seccomp.json); skipped if no syscalls observed.\r\n Disruptive if misapplied — see docs/usage.md\u001b[30X\r\n      --seccomp-profile-out string[=\"-\"]    Output file for an SPO SeccompP\r\nrofile resource wrapping the seccomp profile (default <pod>-seccompprofile.\r\nyaml); requires security-profiles-operator, see docs/usage.md\u001b[14X\r\n      --security-context-out string[=\"-\"]   Output file for a composed secu\r\nrityContext fragment (default <pod>-securitycontext.yaml), combining capabi\r\nlities + seccomp profile — see docs/usage.md\u001b[31X\u001b[44;75H\u001b[1K\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h\r"]
